<title>CANADA: CWB malt barley revs up 58 pct at C$620 mln 1995/6.</title>
<headline>CWB malt barley revs up 58 pct at C$620 mln 1995/6.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Wednesday said its malt barley pool account revenues rose 58.1 percent to C$620 million in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July) versus C$392 million the prior year, the CWB's annual report showed.</p>
<p>			    1995/96			 1994/95</p>
<p> Revs		  $620,029,297	     $392,143,240</p>
<p> Revs/Tonne		$243.196		   $173.496</p>
<p> Tonnes sold	    2,549,505		  2,260,241</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
